Error [E0510]: `core.crypto.expert.aes256gcm_seal` requires an audited `@Unsafe` region
  --> tests/ui/crypto_expert_bypass.jet:11:17
    |
 11 |     _ :: expert.aes256gcm_seal(key, nonce, msg, [])
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: raw crypto primitives may only run inside an explicit expert-tier gate (I1)
 Fix: wrap the call in `@Unsafe("crypto expert: …") { … }` or use `crypto.seal`/`open` instead
